x3575 text "AI-edit acceptance, measured with fresh Claude subagents that had only the primer and the task (13 held-out tasks, six cells, one repair round): with the 342-token primer, Sonnet and Haiku both reach 13 of 13 in every A0 cell, the same as their TypeScript and Rust cells; one-shot rates are 12 or 13 of 13. Output tokens per edit are a tie with TypeScript and Rust. Whole-task cost is a loss, shown above. Full tables including the failures are in the repository ledger. Source: results/*.json, regenerated by bun run exec-bench, tokens, hw, equiv, verify, experiment."
